  "display_title": "Odd Relations: Dear Heewon",
  "description": "Tae-Eun is an omega who relies heavily on his alpha little brother, Tae-Ho. It’s not just because of his fragile health; the only reason he was adopted from a children’s home into the wealthy Kwon family was because a young Tae-Ho claimed he wanted Tae-Eun. Ever since then, Tae-Eun has needed his little brother as an anchor in the unwelcoming sea that is the Kwon household. In fact, he wants Tae-Ho as more than a brother. However, what Tae-Eun doesn’t realize is that Tae-Ho has changed his life in more ways than he ever knew since their first meeting…\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)\n\n*Note: Includes one extra chapter.*",
